    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Rhythm\u00a0</strong>is a high-energy, music-driven 2D side-scrolling space shooter, inspired by the intense action of games like\u00a0<i>R-Type</i> fused with the beautiful rhythmic style of games like\u00a0<i>Rez</i>. Every element moves to the beat\u2014your ship\u2019s weapons fire in sync with the soundtrack, enemies spawn and attack in perfect time, and the vibrant, shifting levels react dynamically to the music. Even your <strong>supermoves</strong> don\u2019t just change the battlefield\u2014they remix the soundtrack in real-time. With multiple game modes and a deep progression system, players can unlock powerful upgrades the more they play, fine-tuning their ship and strategies to match the rhythm of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/08f0f0fce081764313cc2965404135d3.poster.avif?t=1742381003\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/08f0f0fce081764313cc2965404135d3.webm?t=1742381003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/08f0f0fce081764313cc2965404135d3.mp4?t=1742381003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Rhythm\u00a0</strong>is a high-energy, music-driven 2D side-scrolling space shooter, inspired by the intense action of games like\u00a0<i>R-Type</i> fused with the beautiful rhythmic style of games like\u00a0<i>Rez</i>. Every element moves to the beat\u2014your ship\u2019s weapons fire in sync with the soundtrack, enemies spawn and attack in perfect time, and the vibrant, shifting levels react dynamically to the music. Even your <strong>supermoves</strong> don\u2019t just change the battlefield\u2014they remix the soundtrack in real-time. With multiple game modes and a deep progression system, players can unlock powerful upgrades the more they play, fine-tuning their ship and strategies to match the rhythm of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/08f0f0fce081764313cc2965404135d3.poster.avif?t=1742381003\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/08f0f0fce081764313cc2965404135d3.webm?t=1742381003\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3280990/extras/08f0f0fce081764313cc2965404135d3.mp4?t=1742381003\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
